    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade machines in the universe of The Last Shot! In this collection, you can drive a bus, fly a fighter jet, shoot a bow and slingshot, tickle some dinosaurs, robots, and zombies, and defend your base from waves of enemies. A wild mix of arcades, strategy, shoot-\u2019em-ups, physics-based games, and awesome music from street performers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nine arcade machines with a variety of games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original hand-drawn art in the style of vintage cartoons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A chance to return to the familiar streets of a massive dieselpunk city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original music performed by street musicians</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A warm reunion with old friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade machines in the universe of The Last Shot! In this collection, you can drive a bus, fly a fighter jet, shoot a bow and slingshot, tickle some dinosaurs, robots, and zombies, and defend your base from waves of enemies. A wild mix of arcades, strategy, shoot-\u2019em-ups, physics-based games, and awesome music from street performers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nine arcade machines with a variety of games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original hand-drawn art in the style of vintage cartoons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A chance to return to the familiar streets of a massive dieselpunk city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original music performed by street musicians</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A warm reunion with old friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
